# For more info on HTTP files go to https://aka.ms/vs/httpfile
@api = http://localhost:5080
@student = 20152691234567892
@student2 = 20152691234567893
@classId = 94dd8f92-855f-42c9-9eb0-e1f0d65b99a6
@holdId = f2e04865-d9bb-4742-b7ce-54643cf56ba6

### 1. Create a class (2 seats)
POST {{api}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Class 10 - Day Shift", "totalSeats": 1 }

### 2. List classes
GET {{api}}/classes

### 3. Apply (student 1)
POST {{api}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: {{student2}}

### 4. Apply again (student 1) → expect 409 ALREADY_APPLIED
POST {{api}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### 5. Get the application
GET {{api}}/holds/{{holdId}}

### 6. Pay → expect 200 CONFIRMED (send twice: still 200)
POST {{api}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### 7. Pay as another student → expect 403
POST {{api}}/holds/{{holdId}}/confirm
X-Student-Id: {{student2}}

### 8. Cancel → expect 409 CANNOT_CANCEL_CONFIRMED (after paying)
DELETE {{api}}/holds/{{holdId}}
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### 9. My applications
GET {{api}}/me/holds
X-Student-Id: {{student}}

### 10. Bad student ID → expect 400
POST {{api}}/classes/{{classId}}/holds
X-Student-Id: 123